[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15240.95, "timestamp": "04:14:00", "text": "确实如此，但话说回来也挺好玩的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15249.91, "timestamp": "04:14:09", "text": "我觉得那是一大碗拉面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15253.349, "timestamp": "04:14:13", "text": "我甚至都没能看完。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15256.07, "timestamp": "04:14:16", "text": "然后我就把它弄走了。就像我曾经那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15257.83, "timestamp": "04:14:17", "text": "比如，我会把它给我。患病的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15259.99, "timestamp": "04:14:19", "text": "只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15262.469, "timestamp": "04:14:22", "text": "在家煮面条，然后吃掉剩下的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15265.91, "timestamp": "04:14:25", "text": "又是肉汤。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15269.83, "timestamp": "04:14:29", "text": "而之后发生的事情甚至更糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15272.07, "timestamp": "04:14:32", "text": "因为呃，我们当时只是在四处闲逛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15275.189, "timestamp": "04:14:35", "text": "市场区域，嗯，我看到了一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15277.349, "timestamp": "04:14:37", "text": "我戴的那副耳环看起来很漂亮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15279.51, "timestamp": "04:14:39", "text": "于是我们就去了店里，然后我们就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15283.429, "timestamp": "04:14:43", "text": "看到店主开始……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15285.59, "timestamp": "04:14:45", "text": "古怪又轻佻，我完全被迷住了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15288.07, "timestamp": "04:14:48", "text": "尴尬的是，我竟然忘了自己曾经有过这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15291.03, "timestamp": "04:14:51", "text": "我把我的拉面外卖盒放下了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15293.51, "timestamp": "04:14:53", "text": "那里。当时我就想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15295.59, "timestamp": "04:14:55", "text": "呃，我就拿走这只耳环吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15298.389, "timestamp": "04:14:58", "text": "去。是的。再见。我甚至都没讨价还价。"}]